<title>UK: BT Effecten sets warrants on 6.0 pct Bund due 2007.</title>
<headline>BT Effecten sets warrants on 6.0 pct Bund due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued two million dual directional warrants, in four equal tranches, on the 6.0 pct Bund due January 4, 2007, lead manager Bankers Trust International PLC, Frankfurt branch said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   11.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   BERLIN, FFURT, DUSSELDORF, HAMBURG, STUTT</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  101.81</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		PRICE RANGE    PRICE     MATURITY</p>
<p>	     100.50-103.50   3.51 DEM  30.MAY.97</p>
<p>	     100.50-103.50   2.22 DEM  29.AUG.97</p>
<p>	     99.00 -105.00   5.55 DEM  29.AUG.97</p>
<p>	     100.00-104.00   3.40 DEM  29.AUG.97</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
